  "atomic_questions": [
    "Can a workshop split its production hours across all three components (i.e., allocate some hours to component 1, some to component 2, and some to component 3 simultaneously), as long as the total hours used does not exceed its capacity?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking whether simultaneous allocation of hours across components is permitted within capacity limits."
}

